{"game": "the-anacrusis", "language": "english", "appid": 1120480, "month": "2023-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1672531200, "end_date": 1673135999, "month_true_total": 299, "quota": 34, "returned": 34, "pulled_at": "2026-09-03 00:44:09 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "130389211", "author": {"steamid": "76561199013463135", "personaname": "Louti", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199013463135/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1826, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 430, "last_played": 1755386784, "avatar": "bed0ea70367dccc0b915f298909902cd06352bbb"}, "language": "english", "review": "The developers don't lie when they say you can play this over and over. The game is fun and lighthearted and I love the 70s vibe. There are still some minor bugs to the game, but nothing that makes it unplayable or not enjoyable. Overall, I love playing this game with my friends and we probably will add it into our game rotation.", "timestamp_created": 1673135337, "timestamp_updated": 1673135337, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130389086", "author": {"steamid": "76561198102810363", "personaname": "Moist Cake", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Moist__Cake/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 98, "playtime_forever": 68, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 68, "last_played": 1673134277, "avatar": "c3c04ac1be378f6ea25f8f1aeaf3148991945c9b"}, "language": "english", "review": "There's a good foundation here for sure. Visually it's really solid, the environments and alien designs are nice. That's about all it has going for it right now though. The gunplay is weak, animations and sound design lack any impact. The perk system is interesting but really doesn't provide that much variety to the gameplay. The UI is just ugly, and the score was really weak.\nI think there needs to be less effort put into adding more content and more work put towards polishing and improving what they have. I really want Anacrusis to be a good game, I just think it's so far away from where it needs to be for me to call it good.", "timestamp_created": 1673135210, "timestamp_updated": 1673135210, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.442028999328613281", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130387560", "author": {"steamid": "76561198076042674", "personaname": "Andrey", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AndreyFSDev/", "num_games_owned": 1753, "num_reviews": 1349, "playtime_forever": 24, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 24, "last_played": 1673034315, "avatar": "fb293bbac4dfbbd98a85fa04dbbd98ad8395d394"}, "language": "english", "review": "Clone of Left 4 Dead but worst in every aspect.", "timestamp_created": 1673133522, "timestamp_updated": 1673404912, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.556137979030609131", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130385782", "author": {"steamid": "76561199085540690", "personaname": "tripletele", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mrjayden17/", "num_games_owned": 105, "num_reviews": 61, "playtime_forever": 74, "play