"reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130378294", "author": {"steamid": "76561198171028063", "personaname": "and so are the worms", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MaxPlaysYT/", "num_games_owned": 102, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 22, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 22, "last_played": 1673124185, "avatar": "d3eb39d70f297a4191bea908797cd7972a77ad86"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game is horrible, ♥♥♥♥♥♥ ass l4d2 unoptimized as ♥♥♥♥ my c++ calculator app is better", "timestamp_created": 1673124223, "timestamp_updated": 1673124223, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.429988980293273926", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130376282", "author": {"steamid": "76561198144757362", "personaname": "Kriz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198144757362/", "num_games_owned": 261, "num_reviews": 63, "playtime_forever": 15, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 15, "last_played": 1673121804, "avatar": "d92e45511278f544a07276dd23bc22260c573866"}, "language": "english", "review": "Inicie partida y esto ocurrió:\n- El sonido es muy bajo.\n- Los personajes ni mueven la boca cuando hablan.\n- los Aliens ni te atacan, solo corren alrededor tuyo y están diseñados para ser atacados en vez de atacar.\n- la munición es casi infinita entonces no te preocupas en matar a muchos bichos porque hasta estos mueren de un tiro.\n- no hay muchos aliens especiales\n- los movimientos de los personajes son muy simples y nada de otro mundo\n- al final un bicho grande me empujo, me quede pegado en una pared volando y no podía ni moverme ni disparar...\n- salí del juego y lo desinstale.\n\n2/10 \"Este juego me hizo reflexionar que hasta Left 4 Dead 2, un juego del 2009, es mucho más divertido que un juego del 2022\"", "timestamp_created": 1673122322, "timestamp_updated": 1673122322, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.538651347160339355", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130374985", "author": {"steamid": "76561198023118019", "personaname": "kaappi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jaakaappi/", "num_games_owned": 518, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 42, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 42, "last_played": 1673120902, "avatar": "0b93aaf4265dd3f0376fd74678de3aacc357b086"}, "language": "english", "review": "Liked the space ship premise and the idea of episodes, but the runs themselves don't really leverage them.\n\nNot buggy but feels unfinished and shallow, Many mechanics feel copied straight from L4D, same with funny quotes.", "timestamp_created": 1673121188, "timestamp_updated": 1673121188, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.510071277618408203", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130373247", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005814221", "personaname": "Sano", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/planktwobyfour/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 47, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 47, "last_played": 1673060873, "avatar": "cb4d1d8838c1ac49f1f6f112bd6d5b6eb1b9d17a"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's like if you told somebody to make L4D but instead of devoting time to make everything FEEL good they went for the minimum viable product. Everything feels like the bare minimum, flat, and uninspiring. The sound design is flat. The gunplay is bad. Just play some community L4D maps if you really want another L4D game.", "timestamp_created": 1673119579, "timestamp_updated": 1673119579, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.535354971885681152", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130371887", "author": {"steamid": "76561198194316182", "personaname": "GreyToshiaki", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198194316182/", "num_games_owned": 36, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 72, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 24, "last_played": 1673202236, "avatar": "442b4e9455bdf5acd71531aaa1643bca30d318a6"}, "language": "english", "review": "I clicked play and it jumped straight into public game without any tutorial or story, I don't even know what is happening and how to do things. Enemies keep popping in and out because of lag, weapon aim is ♥♥♥♥ you better of spray your bullets all over the place than aiming properly. The game has no directive to where you supposed to go unless you listen very carefully to what the characters are yelling about. There's no button prompt to revive your friends if they are down. \n\nGraphics looks like a PS2 game. You are supposed to make the ENVIRONMENT to be the 70s, not the graphics!", "timestamp_created": 1673118362, "timestamp_updated": 1673118362, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.558273136615753174", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false,