ted": 1673116322, "timestamp_updated": 1673116322, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497325152158737183", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130366365", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046213706", "personaname": "Alphalesbien", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198046213706/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 679, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 337, "last_played": 1775261946, "avatar": "6018c1fc6867cd41078829ffea66e83176f23f1e"}, "language": "english", "review": "can I offer you a. coffee?", "timestamp_created": 1673113448, "timestamp_updated": 1673113448, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130365673", "author": {"steamid": "76561198146146250", "personaname": "@PizzaMan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/2510452995215272/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 218, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 218, "last_played": 1673111294, "avatar": "a21ab06357f5146d68fae83bde552acec778a867"}, "language": "english", "review": "feel like i playing a black 4 blood form turtle rock but it better. \nenemy a bit boring especially a EGG and a brute.\n the AI director love to spam  brute  almost every wave it kinda annoying.\n and a egg sometime they will blocking you only path to the obj and there no way to avoid them. \nyou have to run to the egg either you got down or you kill them in time but mostly you will down. \ngoo and grabber is fine and spawner is kinda nest. what i like about this game mostly it funky style and concept.\n but i do have a high hope the game can be improve and not turn out like black 4 blood dose.\n \n(that it i done with review) \nps if would be nice if dev add a server like Deep rock galactic dose. and add a chat box  no one alway have a voice chat ; - ;", "timestamp_created": 1673112817, "timestamp_updated": 1673113158, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476525843143463135", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130365202", "author": {"steamid": "76561198277588588", "personaname": "xmoOfx369", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198277588588/", "num_games_owned": 59, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 700, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 311, "last_played": 1760929212, "avatar": "0e9895f4d220dfd51e09eb71159721e61e83faf8"}, "language": "english", "review": "i would get this game while its still cheap if i was you.\nthe game has crazy potential not only in the graphics and new ideas\nbut core gameplay. they really need to make it smoother for everyone when playing online, the guns need revamping most def. but its still a fun coop game. i miss the voice lines like from l4d so if they could add a more obvious backstory and stuff to the characters and had voice lines to reflect that it would be more choice. Right now the only thing i can say that is choice is the maps. i love the areas and the ideas. but we need the gameplay to feel more weighty. you can still keep the accuracy of the guns but the gun sounds and the smb recoil should change imo. also i dont know if its just me i dont know if its my FOV but the zombies hit you form miles away", "timestamp_created": 1673112431, "timestamp_updated": 1673112431, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503722071647644043", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130364645", "author": {"steamid": "76561197982718107", "personaname": "outlaw_hat", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/outlaw_hat/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 143, "playtime_forever": 203, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 114, "last_played": 1673174682, "avatar": "e9b1b4351282ebae401f676a395b61ac0700c3c6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Played enough to not recommend. Technical issues aside, I think this game has quite some way to go if it's going to be a descent one.\n\nJudging by the UI - I can't help but feel game was designed with consoles in mind first. Not that that's bad, but  I found it tedious navigating several layers just to mute a player is tedious. I didn't like having voice chat enabled by default (which devs state in several threads is turned off by default). They could add an initial setup when starting the game, so you can turn some things off (make it easier to jump into playing straight away).\n\nVoice callouts could be better. My character (and another) kept yelling about a spawner, but I stayed in one spot for 30 seconds and never got attacked or saw it.\n\nIt was hard to tell if a weapon has default attachments or better ones at times. I feel like everybody copies apex legends when it comes to attachments just to have that system in. A score for each of the 4 attachments to easily compare it with another weapon would do a lot of good here.\n\nThe levels from episode 1 felt kind of bland. Dead robots here and there, no ambient noise coming from anywhere. At times I felt like I had some audio issues. Ducking made the game switch from stereo to mono in my right year :D Directional sound could be better.\n\nI suspect not much will change, since they added achievements recently, \"updated\" matchmaking and the game is leaving gamepass soon, so I feel like this is going to be released as 1.0 very soon. The only updates I can see coming are more episodes and tuning up the story presentation.\n\nAnyway, wait for the full release.", "timestamp_created": 1673111960, "timestamp_updated": 1673163807, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130364109", "author": {"steamid": "76561198099155058", "personaname": "thenoobishere", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198099155058/", "num_games_owned": 134, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 93, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 93, "last_played": 1673111454, "avatar": "b28bd158b95bd5ff73489753f8bc652d622d8d42"}, "language": "english", "review": "no", "timestamp_created": 1673111478, "timestamp_updated": 1673111478, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.472298860549926758", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130363399", "author": {"steamid": "76561198294184348", "personaname": "Kawaii Potato 土豆", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kawaiipotato1104/", "num_games_owned": 298, "num_reviews": 34, "playtime_forever": 105, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 60, "last_played"